1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,000
The hero welcomes us and we need to find the hidden door by the oak tree.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,000
His friend asks if this is the right place, and he says trust me.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000
The door opens into another world, so stay close and follow.

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:12,000
They decide to go through the hidden door together.

5
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,000
Trust me again — this is the right place to begin.
